# Certified operator handoff

Do **not** tell the operator “click X → Y → Z” for a newly built workflow unless Cursor has already completed the equivalent E2E path.

Not proof: route exists · unit test · button renders · build succeeds.

Operator instructions require a certified path (see `docs/BREAK_HARDEN_CERTIFY.md` and `docs/AGENT_CONTINUITY.md`).

Independent profiles: one Google identity = one profile = one workspace. No profile-to-profile create/invite.